natambio (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * NAE: new <pan_scale> control, a mid/side rescale of the decomposition's
    two components, and <pan_rotate>, a rotation of the placement frame that
    tracks the measured axis. Placement smoothed by <pan_scale_tau>. Both
    available in alpha and beta modes; positive closes towards mono.
  * NAE: internal naming reworked around the two components (c1, c2), and the
    beta mode output called ambient rather than surround.

 -- Raul Fernandez Ortega <natambio.audio@gmail.com>  Sat, 15 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0200

natambio (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Split into natambio (real-time JACK client), natambio-tools (offline C
    FIR/DRC generators), natambio-ladspa (LADSPA plugin) and natambio-drc
    (offline Python toolkit).

 -- Raul Fernandez Ortega <natambio.audio@gmail.com>  Tue, 16 Jun 2026 20:02:55 +0200
